"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4414,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得月楼四景分题为梁徵君 其一","author":"庞嵩","text":"宿雨初晴汾水头，月光先到水边楼。\n看春莫待春来暮，花正开时是胜游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4415,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得月楼四景分题为梁徵君 其二","author":"庞嵩","text":"帘捲交疏夏昼长，炎天冰雪自生凉。\n荷风香动前溪月，短弄高歌兴欲狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4416,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得月楼四景分题为梁徵君 其三","author":"庞嵩","text":"玉宇风高秋气清，钧天灵籁静中鸣。\n东篱已办渊明菊，酣饮何妨到月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4417,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得月楼四景分题为梁徵君 其四","author":"庞嵩","text":"朔风吹雪上南枝，东阁官梅欲放时。\n对酒幸逢骚客伴，醉高明月榻初移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4418,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿大径梦中得诗后二句足前寄弟玄圃","author":"庞嵩","text":"初秋凉动暑全消，路入端溪径水遥。\n棣萼有怀情不尽，片云将月过西樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4419,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜惺庵弟得归","author":"庞嵩","text":"春草池塘拂钓矶，九边吾弟自西归。\n金针欲补明皇衮，且得斑斓舞旧衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4420,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜步韵","author":"庞嵩","text":"井梧初滴露光寒，喜见仙娥捧玉盘。\n净洗浮云无点翳，中宵留与万人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4421,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清溪灵泉","author":"庞嵩","text":"灵泉涌出山之腰，澎湃如雷日应潮。\n湛老浚源归去后，几人充量汲颜瓢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4422,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宜章寄玄圃弟","author":"庞嵩","text":"万青排汉拥屏门，山内孤城郭外村。\n百曲溪流开线路，忽闻鸡犬讶桃源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4423,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望岳步湛先师韵 其一","author":"庞嵩","text":"一卧天关已十年，出门三札信虚传。\n今朝得睹衡云面，七十二峰都眼前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4424,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望岳步湛先师韵 其二","author":"庞嵩","text":"定脚撑天天柱峰，云翻雨覆自孤踪。\n谁同绝巘跻云顶，共坐空濛紫翠重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4425,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"衡山追和","author":"庞嵩","text":"支策罗浮七洞天，祝融绝顶访栖禅。\n天空籁息钟初定，独扫云根枕月眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4426,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"予偕周明府暨仲儿一德遍谒衡岳方广诸院有怀文定致堂五峰晦庵南轩择之诸贤","author":"庞嵩","text":"胡氏隐居同父子，朱张游屐有师生。\n衡山千载遗芳躅，父子师生几共行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4427,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重登燕子矶","author":"庞嵩","text":"燕子矶头老燕飞，阅穷金舄与绯衣。\n几人解绂归山后，白发重来上翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4428,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答巾石翁赠别","author":"庞嵩","text":"千里游遨得再同，共看新月坐光风。\n有言话到无言处，归棹嬉游自在中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4429,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"勉诸生","author":"庞嵩","text":"千秋绝学归尼父，志学原基十五时。\n谩向六经寻口诀，直从当下认良知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4430,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高淳民芮首忠得心疾予一言药之而瘳兹来见诗以赠归","author":"庞嵩","text":"羡尔南来路四千，此心原可对青天。\n翳门关外罗浮月，满照珠江归去船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4431,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诒隐者","author":"庞嵩","text":"甲子周天周复旋，人间尔亦小神仙。\n儿孙晓舞仍环膝，郭野春深又种田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4432,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠廖生文亮归广右","author":"庞嵩","text":"子来渐识观山意，步转朱明已石楼。\n高处却从平地起，莫忘披径继重游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4433,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠林生净归高吴","author":"庞嵩","text":"看山未陟飞云嵿，漫说飞云第一峰。\n踏上飞云峰嵿望，飞云天外又重重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4434,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题壁画龙","author":"庞嵩","text":"滚滚江波万顷寒，老龙腾跃出江干。\n鞭霆叱雨凌云驾，留得图形万古看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4435,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿沈母","author":"庞嵩","text":"仙子凌空跨鹤来，碧桃香荐紫霞杯。\n不须海上论筹算，祇看梅花岁岁开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4436,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"勉诸子","author":"庞嵩","text":"乱雪凌空半拥衾，揭题呵笔冻难禁。\n江山画里看描迹，要识良工苦用心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":4437,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]